   43           BFFA        .org $BFFA     ;first of the three vectors starts here
   44  05:BFFA  B8 DC       .dw NMI        ;when an NMI happens (once per frame if enabled) the 
   45                                        ;processor will jump to the label NMI:
   46  05:BFFC  00 C0       .dw RESET      ;when the processor first turns on or is reset, it will jump
