  210  06:D45E            .innerloop:
  211  06:D45E  B1 18             LDA [table_address], y
  212  06:D460  8D 07 20          STA PPU_DATA
  213  06:D463  C8                INY
  214  06:D464  CC 00 00          CPY DATA_LEN
  215  06:D467  90 F5             BCC .innerloop ;table should have the size in it, but since we count the byte count, we'll want to wait till we go over it
  216  06:D469  F0 F3             BEQ .innerloop
