    1                     ;;Object drawing utils
    2                     ;;when loading objects, we have a few choices:
    3                     ;;0     raw object - load directly from a table, use commands in table to control addresses
    4                     ;;1     window Object - load a window from a small 3x3 table of data
    5                     ;;2     -puzzle widow - same as above, but with a special fill type
    6                     ;;3 separator - load a line across the screen of a given tile
